# Always deploy every change

After any code or content change, publish it. Do not wait for the user to ask.

This project is published **only through GitHub**. Do not deploy to Vercel.

## Live site

https://valentynpi.github.io/pidlypna-art/

Repo: https://github.com/ValentynPi/pidlypna-art

## Required workflow after every change

1. Run `npm run build` locally if the change is substantial; fix any errors.
2. Commit the relevant files immediately (user asked to always deploy; do not wait).
3. Push to `main`:

```powershell
cd "d:\Sandbox\Paint web site 2.0"
git push origin main
```

4. GitHub Actions (`Deploy GitHub Pages`) builds and publishes automatically.
5. Wait for the Pages workflow (`gh run list` / `gh run watch`).
6. Share the live URL: https://valentynpi.github.io/pidlypna-art/

## Notes

- Do **not** run `npx vercel` or any Vercel deploy.
- Image paths use `import.meta.env.BASE_URL` so they work under `/pidlypna-art/`.
